{"unit_id":"tag:0DDK:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的范例是局部紧（locally compact）拓扑空间（topological spaces）上通常拓扑（topology）与 qc 拓扑（topology）的比较，如《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》第<REF_0001>节所讨论。先回顾《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0002>节及第<REF_0003>节的一些材料。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是 fppf 景（site）。在相同的底层范畴（underlying category）上有第二个拓扑（topology），即平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology），因此有第二个景（site）<MATH_0003>。恒等（identity）函子（functor）<MATH_0004>连续（continuous），定义景（sites）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0005>\n。见《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》第<REF_0004>节。请注意，<MATH_0006>是底层预层（underlying presheaves）上的恒等（identity）函子（functor），而<MATH_0007>给一个平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）层（sheaf）对应其 fppf 层化（sheafification）。设<MATH_0008>为小（small）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）景（site）。有景（sites）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0009>\n，由连续（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0010>、<MATH_0011>给出。具体而言，<MATH_0012>具有纤维积（fibre products）和终对象（final object），上面的函子（functor）与这些运算交换（commutes），因此《景（Sites）》的命题<REF_0005>适用。\n\n","allowed_english":["qc","fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally compact","target_term":"局部紧"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"underlying presheaves","target_term":